  "html": "<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"-------png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:136px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/zh/wiki/File:%E5%A6%B9%E5%A6%B9.png\" title=\"妹妹.png (247 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:136px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/7/70/%E5%A6%B9%E5%A6%B9.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/136?cb=20251023162227&amp;path-prefix=zh\" title=\"妹妹.png (247 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"妹妹.png\" data-image-key=\"%E5%A6%B9%E5%A6%B9.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"妹妹.png (247 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"妹妹.png\" data-image-key=\"%E5%A6%B9%E5%A6%B9.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/7/70/%E5%A6%B9%E5%A6%B9.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/136?cb=20251023162227&amp;path-prefix=zh\"></a></div></div></div></div><p>【角色名】妹妹\n</p><p>【初始区域】神社\n</p><p>【禁行区域】无\n</p><p>【不安限度】 3\n</p><p>【属性】 少女·妹妹\n</p><p>【特性】剧本制作时，该角色的身份不可以为有无视友好特性的身份\n</p><p>【友好能力】（友好5）同一区域的1名成人使用1个友好能力，此时无视该成人的友好指示物数量。即使该成人带有无视友好特性，也不能拒绝使用那个能力。但能力依然受到次数限制。\n</p><p>【感想】　到了AHR，不能拒绝的妹妹也被影响了。。。\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260927033146\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 secon